{% doc %}
  Cart drawer (TE-5 AC1–AC4, AC8, AC10, frame AC15; mini-cart-quickview.md §1, §2).
  Composed in layout/theme.liquid after the footer container, with no container
  of its own: the dialog sits outside the page flow and is not a band. Reads the
  global `cart`, the cart_type and free_shipping_threshold theme settings and
  the block settings show_order_note and empty_cart_products.

  Root custom element cart-drawer always renders, so its script loads on every
  page. data-mode is 'drawer', or 'none' when cart_type is page or the template
  is cart. Only 'drawer' renders the dialog.

  Without JavaScript the dialog stays closed and the header cart link goes to
  routes.cart_url. JavaScript opens it with showModal(). The close button uses
  form method="dialog", so it closes without JavaScript.

  Layer (ADR 0007, layers.md): modal-dialog data-layer="cart" wraps the dialog;
  the dialog uses the shared drawer frame (.drawer .drawer--end .drawer--wide:
  90% / 420 from 48rem / 480 from 80rem, scrim 50%, slide from the inline end).

  Inside the dialog, in order:
  - Header 72 (.drawer__header), outside cart-items: h2 "Cart", item count pill
    (partial cart-drawer-count, hidden when the cart is empty), "View cart" link
    to routes.cart_url, round close button 48.
  - Custom element cart-items holds cart-items-status (role status) and
    cart-items-error (role alert), both empty on load and first in DOM order
    (assets/cart-items.js writes into the first role status and role alert).
  - Body (.drawer__body, scrolls on its own), in order:
    1. "Added to cart" region: role status wrapper, its box is hidden on load.
       JavaScript (ES1-T98) fills data-cart-added-item with "{title} · {variant}"
       and removes hidden after an add; sets hidden again when the drawer closes
       or on any other cart action. It never hides on a timer.
    2. Partial cart-drawer (name must match the JS): root cart-drawer-body with
       data-item-count, then form id cart-form-drawer with free shipping, lines
       (or the empty state plus up to 2 products from empty_cart_products).
    3. Order note (show_order_note, default on): details closed on load,
       outside the partial so a refresh keeps the typed text and the open state.
       Textarea name note, form cart-form-drawer: Checkout posts it with the
       form; JavaScript saves it on change (hook data-note). CSS hides it when
       the cart is empty.
  - Footer (.drawer__footer, dark panel, not sticky inside the body so focus is
    never under it): partial cart-drawer-footer with snippets/cart-summary,
    then the accelerated checkout wrapper, outside the partial because
    Shopify's script mounts the buttons and a refresh would drop them. Hidden
    when the cart is empty; JavaScript syncs hidden from data-item-count after
    a refresh. CSS hides the footer when the summary is absent.

  Partials refreshed together (data-partials on cart-items): cart-drawer,
  cart-drawer-count, cart-drawer-footer, cart-count.

  cart-drawer hooks: data-mode, data-cart-url, data-items-src (assets/cart-items.js
  URL, imported on first open).
  cart-items hooks: data-cart-change-url, data-cart-url, data-partials,
  data-label-updated, data-label-removed, data-label-error,
  data-label-quantity-adjusted. JavaScript sets data-enhanced (CSS hides the
  Update button) and aria-busy. Line hooks are listed in snippets/cart-lines.liquid.
  Other hooks: data-cart-added, data-cart-added-item, data-note (textarea),
  data-cart-accelerated.

  Test hooks: cart-drawer, cart-drawer-dialog, cart-drawer-heading,
  cart-drawer-count, cart-drawer-view-cart, cart-drawer-close, cart-drawer-added,
  cart-drawer-body, cart-drawer-bestsellers, cart-drawer-note,
  cart-drawer-note-input, cart-drawer-footer, cart-drawer-accelerated, plus
  cart-items, cart-items-status, cart-items-error, cart-form and the snippet hooks.

  Self-contained: callers must leave the body empty.

  @example
  {% block 'cart-drawer' -%}{%- endblock %}
{% enddoc %}

{%- liquid
  assign cart_type = settings.cart_type | default: 'drawer'
  assign mode = 'drawer'
  if cart_type == 'page' or template.name == 'cart'
    assign mode = 'none'
  endif
-%}

<cart-drawer
  class="cart-drawer"
  data-mode="{{ mode }}"
  data-cart-url="{{ routes.cart_url }}"
  data-items-src="{{ 'cart-items.js' | asset_url }}"
  data-testid="cart-drawer"
  {{ block.shopify_attributes }}
>
  {%- if mode == 'drawer' -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign label_updated = 'cart.updated' | t
      assign label_removed = 'cart.removed' | t
      assign label_error = 'cart.error' | t
      assign label_quantity_adjusted = 'cart.quantity_adjusted' | t
      assign empty_collection = block.settings.empty_cart_products
      assign empty_url = ''
      if empty_collection != blank
        assign empty_url = empty_collection.url
      endif
    -%}
    <modal-dialog data-layer="cart">
      <dialog
        id="CartDrawer"
        class="drawer drawer--end drawer--wide cart-drawer__dialog"
        scroll-lock
        aria-labelledby="CartDrawerHeading"
        data-testid="cart-drawer-dialog"
      >
        <div class="drawer__header cart-drawer__head">
          <div class="cart-drawer__title">
            <h2 id="CartDrawerHeading" class="drawer__title" data-testid="cart-drawer-heading">
              {{- 'cart.title' | t -}}
            </h2>
            {% partial 'cart-drawer-count' %}
              <span
                class="cart-drawer__count"
                {% if cart.item_count == 0 %}
                  hidden
                {% endif %}
                data-testid="cart-drawer-count"
              >
                {{- 'cart.item_count' | t: count: cart.item_count -}}
              </span>
            {% endpartial %}
          </div>
          <a class="cart-drawer__view-cart" href="{{ routes.cart_url }}" data-testid="cart-drawer-view-cart">
            {{- 'cart.view_cart' | t -}}
          </a>
          <form method="dialog">
            {% # aria-label, not hidden text: the dialog is closed (display: none) on load, so a name from hidden content is empty. %}
            <button
              class="close-button"
              aria-label="{{ 'blocks.cart_drawer.close' | t }}"
              data-testid="cart-drawer-close"
            >
              {% render 'header-icon', name: 'close' %}
            </button>
          </form>
        </div>

        <cart-items
          class="cart-items cart-drawer__items"
          data-cart-change-url="{{ routes.cart_change_url }}"
          data-cart-url="{{ routes.cart_url }}"
          data-partials="cart-drawer cart-drawer-count cart-drawer-footer cart-count"
          data-label-updated="{{ label_updated | escape }}"
          data-label-removed="{{ label_removed | escape }}"
          data-label-error="{{ label_error | escape }}"
          data-label-quantity-adjusted="{{ label_quantity_adjusted | escape }}"
          data-testid="cart-items"
        >
          <div class="visually-hidden" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-testid="cart-items-status"></div>
          <div class="cart-items__error" role="alert" data-testid="cart-items-error"></div>

          <div class="drawer__body cart-drawer__main">
            <div class="cart-drawer__added" role="status" data-testid="cart-drawer-added">
              <p class="cart-drawer__added-box" data-cart-added hidden>
                <span class="cart-drawer__added-icon">{% render 'status-icon', name: 'success' %}</span>
                <span class="cart-drawer__added-text">
                  <strong>{{ 'cart.added' | t }}</strong>
                  <span data-cart-added-item></span>
                </span>
              </p>
            </div>

            {% partial 'cart-drawer' %}
              <div class="cart-drawer__body" data-item-count="{{ cart.item_count }}" data-testid="cart-drawer-body">
                <form
                  id="cart-form-drawer"
                  class="cart-drawer__form"
                  action="{{ routes.cart_url }}"
                  method="post"
                  data-testid="cart-form"
                >
                  {%- render 'cart-free-shipping', cart: cart, context: 'drawer' -%}
                  {%- render 'cart-lines', cart: cart, context: 'drawer', empty_url: empty_url -%}
                </form>

                {%- if cart.item_count == 0 and empty_collection.products_count > 0 -%}
                  <div class="cart-drawer__bestsellers" data-testid="cart-drawer-bestsellers">
                    <h3 class="cart-drawer__bestsellers-heading">{{ 'cart.bestsellers' | t }}</h3>
                    <ul class="cart-drawer__bestsellers-list" role="list">
                      {%- for suggestion in empty_collection.products limit: 2 -%}
                        <li class="cart-drawer__bestseller">
                          <a class="cart-drawer__bestseller-media" href="{{ suggestion.url }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
                            {%- if suggestion.featured_image -%}
                              {%- render 'image',
                                image: suggestion.featured_image,
                                class: 'cart-drawer__bestseller-image',
                                width: 128,
                                height: 128,
                                crop: 'center',
                                widths: '64, 128',
                                sizes: '64px',
                                decorative: true
                              -%}
                            {%- else -%}
                              <span class="cart-drawer__bestseller-image">{% render 'status-icon', name: 'box' %}</span>
                            {%- endif -%}
                          </a>
                          <div class="cart-drawer__bestseller-info">
                            <a class="cart-drawer__bestseller-title" href="{{ suggestion.url }}">{{ suggestion.title | escape }}</a>
                            {%- render 'price', product: suggestion -%}
                          </div>
                        </li>
                      {%- endfor -%}
                    </ul>
                  </div>
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>
            {% endpartial %}

            {%- if block.settings.show_order_note -%}
              <details class="cart-drawer__note" data-testid="cart-drawer-note">
                <summary class="cart-drawer__note-toggle">
                  <span class="cart-drawer__note-icon">{% render 'status-icon', name: 'edit' %}</span>
                  {{- 'cart.note_toggle' | t -}}
                  {% render 'header-icon', name: 'chevron' %}
                </summary>
                <div class="cart-drawer__note-body">
                  <label class="cart-drawer__note-label" for="CartDrawer-note">{{ 'cart.note_label' | t }}</label>
                  <textarea
                    id="CartDrawer-note"
                    class="cart-drawer__note-input"
                    name="note"
                    rows="4"
                    form="cart-form-drawer"
                    aria-describedby="CartDrawer-note-hint"
                    data-note
                    data-testid="cart-drawer-note-input"
                  >{{ cart.note | escape }}</textarea>
                  <p id="CartDrawer-note-hint" class="cart-drawer__note-hint">{{ 'cart.note_hint' | t }}</p>
                </div>
              </details>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>

          <div class="drawer__footer cart-drawer__footer" data-testid="cart-drawer-footer">
            {% partial 'cart-drawer-footer' %}
              {%- render 'cart-summary', cart: cart, context: 'drawer' -%}
            {% endpartial %}

            {%- if additional_checkout_buttons -%}
              <div
                class="cart-drawer__accelerated"
                {% if cart.item_count == 0 %}
                  hidden
                {% endif %}
                data-cart-accelerated
                data-testid="cart-drawer-accelerated"
              >
                {{- content_for_additional_checkout_buttons -}}
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        </cart-items>
      </dialog>
    </modal-dialog>
  {%- endif -%}
  <script src="{{ 'cart-drawer.js' | asset_url }}" type="module"></script>
</cart-drawer>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:general.cart_drawer",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "show_order_note",
      "label": "t:labels.show_order_note",
      "info": "t:info.show_order_note",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "type": "collection",
      "id": "empty_cart_products",
      "label": "t:labels.empty_cart_products",
      "info": "t:info.empty_cart_products"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
